                ],
                "id": "50423583",
                "src": "\\begin{array}{l}\\mathrm{Anode}:\\;\\mathrm{Cl}^-(l)\\;\\;\\rightarrow\\;\\;{\\mathrm{Cl}}_2(g)\\;+\\;2\\;\\mathrm e^-\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;E_{\\mathrm{anode}}^\\circ\\;=\\;+1.358\\;\\mathrm V\\\\\\mathrm{Cathode}:\\;\\mathrm{Al}^{3+}(aq)\\;+\\;3\\;\\mathrm e^-\\;\\;\\rightarrow\\;\\;\\mathrm{Al}(\\mathrm l)\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;E_{\\mathrm{cathode}}^\\circ\\;=\\;-1.662\\;\\mathrm V\\\\\\\\E_{\\mathrm{cell}}^\\circ\\;=\\;E_{\\mathrm{cathode}}^\\circ\\; -\\;E_{\\mathrm{anode}}^\\circ\\;=\\;(-1.662\\;\\mathrm V)\\;-\\;1.358\\;\\mathrm V\\;=\\;-3.02\\;\\mathrm V\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\end{array}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Therefore, the applied voltage must be at least +3.02 V for the reaction to occur. "
